  "solution": {
    "text": "Let tangent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br />and tangent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8869;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo